<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>零不是目标。</h1><p class="pc-lead">潜力需个别探索，不能由两种状态的差值计算。</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>个人满意度：0为完全不满意，10为完全满意。非临床量表。</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">身体</p><h3>活动与舒适度</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">当前</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 未评估</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">期望</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 未评估</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">潜在</span><div class="pc-unknown">尚未确定</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">认知</p><h3>注意力</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">当前</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 未评估</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">